	(property "Description" "LCDWIKI ES3C28P I2C socket P4 on a JST PH B4B-PH-K-S header, 2.0mm, pins 1:1. Pin 1 3V3: ES3C28P output, its 3.3V regulator. Pin 2 GND. Pin 3 SCL: GPIO15, ES3C28P is the controller. Pin 4 SDA: GPIO16, bidirectional. Both pulled to 3.3V by 4.7k on the ES3C28P; the bus also carries its touch controller (0x38) and audio codec (0x18). Pin order from the LCDWIKI schematic and print, confirmed on a delivered board."
